@node Top
@top Counterpart User Guide

Version: 0.2.0

Copyright © 2026 @w{Charles Y. Choi}

@strong{Counterpart} is a macOS utility to open the counterpart of a Texinfo (@ref{Top,,,texinfo,}) web page in GNU Emacs Info (@ref{Top,,,info,}).

@strong{Counterpart} requires usage of the Safari web browser and installation of an iCloud Shortcut.

@strong{Counterpart} only works on Texinfo HTML generated with one page per node.

If you enjoy using @strong{Counterpart}@comma{} please consider buying me a coffee to help support its development and maintenance.

@uref{https://www.buymeacoffee.com/kickingvegas}

@end ifnottex

